  3.14159265: bf16       3.140625 | fp16       3.140625
       1e-08: bf16 9.953510016202927e-09 | fp16            0.0
     70000.0: bf16        69632.0 | fp16            inf
         0.1: bf16    0.099609375 | fp16 0.0999755859375
fp16 overflows above 65504 and flushes tiny gradients toward zero, which is why it needs loss scaling; bf16 keeps the range but loses precision
